{"projectInfo":{"name":"集中式VXLAN IP网关配置举例","path":"vxlan_ip","visibility":2,"categoryId":51,"introduction":"Router A、Router C为与服务器连接的VTEP设备，Router B为与广域网连接的集中式VXLAN IP网关设备，Internet为广域网内的三层设备。虚拟机VM 1、VM 2同属于VXLAN 10，通过VXLAN实现不同站点间的二层互联，并通过VXLAN IP网关与广域网三层互联。具体需求为：不同VTEP之间手工建立VXLAN隧道。手工关联VXLAN和VXLAN隧道。通过源MAC地址动态学习远端MAC地址表项。站点之间的泛洪流量采用头端复制的方式转发。","label":["VXLAN","VTEP","VM"]},"deviceInfoList":[{"resourceName":"RTA","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTA.cfg"},{"resourceName":"RTC","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTC.cfg"},{"resourceName":"RTB","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTB.cfg"},{"resourceName":"P","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\P.cfg"},{"resourceName":"VM-1","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\VM-1.cfg"},{"resourceName":"VM-2","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\VM-2.cfg"},{"resourceName":"Internet","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\Internet.cfg"}]}